  "Id": 3864,
  "Title": "AKU Champions Paediatric Care with Tee Off for Kids",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Annual Golf Tournament expands access to life-saving care for children in need at AKUH",
  "GlobalNews": true,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) hosted its 8th annual Tee Off for Kids Golf Tournament at the Karachi Golf Club, uniting corporate leaders, philanthropists, and golf enthusiasts to support life-saving treatment for children in need at the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) in Karachi. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Since 2016, when the tournament first brought corporate donors together to support the Mending Kids' Hearts campaign for congenital heart disease, donor generosity has helped perform hundreds of life-saving cardiac procedures each year-providing vital financial assistance to over 70% of young patients from low-income families."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Building on this generosity, the scope of this year's tournament expanded to support a wider range of critical paediatric treatments, including cancer care, treatment for heart diseases, cochlear implants, therapies for children with special needs. The goal remains clear: to ease the burden on families facing overwhelming challenges and give children the chance to grow, thrive and pursue the futures they deserve."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Siddiq Sons claimed the championship title at this year's golf tournament, proudly lifting the coveted winners' trophy after a standout performance. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "As a leader in paediatric health care, AKUH remains deeply committed to ensuring that every child, regardless of circumstance, has access to quality treatment and hope for a healthier future. Children continue to be the major beneficiaries of AKUH's patient welfare programme, which provides access to quality care for patients from low-income backgrounds. From January to October 2025, over PKR 600 million was disbursed for inpatient paediatric care across AKUH and its outreach hospitals, with children making up 33% of all inpatient beneficiaries. "
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
